{
  "label": "Discussion & Collaboration",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Team Discussion & Collaboration",
      "id": "discussion",
      "intro": "Fitur discussion memungkinkan tim fraud analyst berkolaborasi dalam penanganan alert. Support real-time chat, file sharing, search, dan @mention.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Akses Discussion Panel",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka detail alert yang ingin didiskusikan\n• Klik tab **Discussion** di detail panel\n• Panel chat WhatsApp-style akan muncul\n• Auto-load conversation history\n• Real-time refresh untuk pesan baru",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Team Discussion</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Real-time Collaboration</div></div><div style=\"margin-left:auto;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">💬 Chat</span></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(59,130,246,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">Real-time</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(5,150,105,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#059669;\">File Share</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Search</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(124,58,237,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">@Mention</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Send Messages & Comments",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Ketik pesan di text area bawah\n• **Enter** — Kirim pesan\n• **Shift + Enter** — New line dalam pesan\n• Pesan akan langsung muncul di chat\n• Status indicator: ⏱️ Sending → ✓ Sent → ✓✓ Read\n• Optimistic UI: pesan muncul instant sebelum server confirm",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Compose Message</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:8px;\"><textarea style=\"width:100%;border:none;background:transparent;resize:none;font-size:10px;\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"Type your message...\"></textarea></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:flex-end;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Shift + Enter</span><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f59e0b;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">📤 Send</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Attach Files & Images",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik ikon **📎 Paperclip** untuk attach files\n• Support format:\n  - Images: JPG, PNG, GIF (preview inline)\n  - Documents: PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint\n  - Max 3MB per file\n• Drag & drop files ke chat window\n• Multiple files attach sekaligus\n• Preview sebelum send",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21.44 11.05l-9.19 9.19a6 6 0 01-8.49-8.49l9.19-9.19a4 4 0 015.66 5.66l-9.2 9.19a2 2 0 01-2.83-2.83l8.49-8.48\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">File Attachments</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);border:1px dashed #c7d2fe;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"margin:0 auto 4px;\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4M17 8l-5-5-5 5M12 3v12\"/></svg><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;margin-bottom:2px;\">Drop files here</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">or click to browse • Max 3MB</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#dc2626\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\" fill=\"white\"/></svg><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">report.pdf</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">245 KB</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#16a34a\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" fill=\"#22c55e\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"15\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">screenshot.png</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">512 KB</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Search Messages",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik ikon **🔍 Search** di header chat\n• Panel search muncul di sisi kanan\n• Ketik keyword untuk search\n• Hasil search ditampilkan real-time\n• Highlight keyword dalam pesan\n• Navigate: ⬆️ Previous / ⬇️ Next result\n• Klik result untuk scroll ke pesan\n• Keyboard shortcuts: Arrow Up/Down, Esc to close",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Search Messages</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">3/12</span><button style=\"padding:4px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M18 15l-6-6-6 6\"/></svg></button><button style=\"padding:4px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-bottom:8px;\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Type keywords...\" style=\"width:100%;border:none;background:transparent;font-size:10px;\" value=\"fraud pattern\"/></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px;\">John Analyst • 2:45 PM</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Detected suspicious <mark style=\"background:#fde047;padding:1px 3px;border-radius:2px;font-weight:700;\">fraud pattern</mark> in last 24 hours...</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "View Participants & Activity",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **View Participants** di header\n• List semua analyst yang terlibat\n• Status online/offline indicator\n• Avatar & profile info\n• Role badge (Analyst, Supervisor, Admin)\n• Activity log: Who joined/left, lock/unlock actions\n• Auto-refresh participant list",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Participants (4)</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-col;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdfa;border:1px solid #5eead4;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#14b8a6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">JD</span><div style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#16a34a;border:2px solid #fff;position:absolute;bottom:-2px;right:-2px;\"></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">John Analyst</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Active now</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">ANALYST</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#6366f1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">MS</span><div style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#94a3b8;border:2px solid #fff;position:absolute;bottom:-2px;right:-2px;\"></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Maria Supervisor</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">15 mins ago</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f5f3ff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">SUPERVISOR</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
